# claude plugin validate で $ の渡り先の書き方を確かめた記録（2.1.328 (Claude Code)）

esbuild はまとめるときに最上位の const を var にするため、var の形も確かめた。

## const: /tmp/validate-699/const
```js
const readTheme = async ($) => $.settings.read({ key: "theme" });
const renderReply = async ($, e, next) => { await readTheme($); return next(e); };
export function register(on) { on("ui.render", { component: "AssistantMessage" }, renderReply); }
```
$ claude plugin validate /tmp/validate-699/const
  ❯ modules: hooks/mod.js
✔ Validation passed with warnings

## var: /tmp/validate-699/var
```js
var readTheme = async ($) => $.settings.read({ key: "theme" });
var renderReply = async ($, e, next) => { await readTheme($); return next(e); };
export function register(on) { on("ui.render", { component: "AssistantMessage" }, renderReply); }
```
$ claude plugin validate /tmp/validate-699/var
✘ Found 1 error:
  ❯ modules../mod.js: var: /tmp/validate-699/var/hooks/mod.js:3: the hook "renderReply" is not a function declared at the top of this file (a function declaration, or a const bound to a function), nor imported from one of the module's own files; $ is always spelled $.noun.event(...) at the call site, on is always on("<event>", hook), and next.to always next.to(e, "<tier>")
✘ Validation failed

## object: /tmp/validate-699/object
```js
async function readTheme(options) { return options.$.settings.read({ key: "theme" }); }
async function renderReply($, e, next) { await readTheme({ $ }); return next(e); }
export function register(on) { on("ui.render", { component: "AssistantMessage" }, renderReply); }
```
$ claude plugin validate /tmp/validate-699/object
✘ Found 1 error:
  ❯ modules../mod.js: object: /tmp/validate-699/object/hooks/mod.js:2: $ itself is put in an object (bound, passed, spread, returned or read); $ is always spelled $.noun.event(...) at the call site, on is always on("<event>", hook), and next.to always next.to(e, "<tier>")
✘ Validation failed

